            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "👋\n\n> I've wanted this feature too from Neovim - is this something you're currently working on or could I take a stab at implementing it?\n\nThanks for the suggestion! I haven't read or thought about this in a while. Rereading it now,\n\nI am not sure if this is a good idea. It does look like something that should be supported by Neovim (and Vim) natively. So maybe a better idea is to try to add this upstream? You can start by creating a feature request (if there is none already) to gather a feedback?\n\nThe 'lewis6991/fileline.nvim' plugin is written by the Neovim core member, so there is a good chance to make it built-in I think.",
